Z||000000||HAGS||02-01-2001||04:41 AM||||My friend got me to download this program and it might work really well for us as a replacement to the very busy chat thats already here...<BR>If you have ICQ check it out, <BR> <A HREF="http://www.icq.com/icqsurf" TARGET=_blank>www.icq.com/icqsurf</A> <BR>doesnt change anything on your regular ICQ messanger but opens up a chatroom type thing around your browser instead of a new window...the chat room lists all people currently viewing the domain and they can all see each other and chat...<BR>domain=www.fiero.nl  so it doesnt matter what thread your in your still in the domain.  You can also lock yourself in that chatroom if you want to goto a different page but still stay in the room.||||reg||1
